Featured Projects

All Analytics Operations Forecasting Market




&lt;h4&gt;Operational Efficiency Dashboard&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Automated an executive view of operational KPIs; unified data sources and standardized definitions for consistent decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Impact:&lt;/em&gt; 75% less manual reporting; improved cross-team alignment&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Stack:&lt;/em&gt; Power BI, SQL, Excel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;details&gt;
  &lt;summary&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What I did&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;
  &lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Mapped disparate source tables to a governed semantic layer with clear metric ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Designed drill-through dashboards for weekly business reviews and ad-hoc analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Automated refresh with scheduled jobs and validation checks.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;



&lt;h4&gt;Predictive Business Forecasting&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built forecasting models to anticipate volume and revenue trends, informing staffing and inventory planning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Impact:&lt;/em&gt; +20% forecast accuracy vs prior approach&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Stack:&lt;/em&gt; Python (pandas, scikit-learn), SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;details&gt;
  &lt;summary&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What I did&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;
  &lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Developed and compared baselines (MA, ETS) with tree-based models; selected by MAPE + stability.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Implemented backtests with rolling windows and champion/challenger process.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Packaged output to feed Power BI visuals and capacity planning sheets.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;



&lt;h4&gt;Pricing & Market Analysis&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Performed price elasticity and customer segmentation to surface margin opportunities and targeted offers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Impact:&lt;/em&gt; Clear levers for profitable growth and retention&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Stack:&lt;/em&gt; Python, SQL, Tableau&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;details&gt;
  &lt;summary&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What I did&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;
  &lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Built clustering (K-means) for segment discovery; profiled value drivers and churn risk.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Estimated elasticity bands; identified safe move corridors for promotional pricing.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Created exec-ready storyboards with insight → action recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;



&lt;h4&gt;Service Operations Optimization&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mapped end-to-end processes, identified bottlenecks, and optimized staffing and task routing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Impact:&lt;/em&gt; Higher throughput with improved employee and customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Stack:&lt;/em&gt; Excel/Sheets, SQL, Python (sim/queues optional)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;details&gt;
  &lt;summary&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What I did&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;
  &lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Time-and-motion and arrival pattern analysis; balanced queue discipline vs. SLA risk.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Introduced standardized SOPs and KPI scorecards.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Partnered with leads to embed the changes and monitor adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;



&lt;h4&gt;AI vs Non-AI Careers (Portfolio Study)&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comparative analysis of market signals for AI vs. non-AI roles; trends, skills, and pay bands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Stack:&lt;/em&gt; Python, CSV/JSON, GitHub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;details&gt;
  &lt;summary&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What I did&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;
  &lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Collected and cleaned multiple open datasets; standardized job families and titles.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Produced visual summaries and a narrative readout.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;

