Core Skills (Expandable)


Analytics & Decision Support



Exploratory Analysis · KPI Design · Executive Reporting


Forecasting · Scenario Modeling (Python/R, Excel)


Data-driven recommendations for strategic planning





Operations & Optimization



Process Mapping · Bottleneck Discovery · Workflow Automation


Operational Dashboards (Power BI/Tableau)


Continuous Improvement & Lean Principles





Tools & Methods



Python (pandas, scikit-learn) · R · SQL · Power BI/Tableau · Excel


Segmentation · Regression · Time-Series Modeling


Git/GitHub · Quarto







